<!DOCTYPE html>

<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"/>
<meta content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" name="viewport"/>
<title>20261022国内电力看板 手机版 - 2.3 大洋洲日度</title>
<style>
    :root {
      --bg:#f5f1ea; --paper:#fffdf9; --ink:#111827; --muted:#687080; --line:#cfd6e3;
      --navy:#0b2f66; --blue:#4f7dbf; --red:#dc2626; --soft:#f8fafc;
    }
    * { box-sizing:border-box; }
    body { margin:0; padding-left:154px; background:var(--bg); color:var(--ink); font-family:"Times New Roman","KaiTi","楷体","STKaiti",serif; }
    .page { position:relative; width:min(1680px, calc(100% - 28px)); margin:14px auto 40px; background:var(--paper); border:1px solid #d7d0c6; box-shadow:0 8px 28px rgba(64,46,26,.08); }
    header { padding:22px 28px 16px; border-bottom:3px solid var(--navy); }
    h1 { margin:0; font-size:30px; letter-spacing:0; color:var(--navy); }
    .subtitle { margin-top:7px; color:var(--muted); font-size:13px; }
    main { padding:0 22px 28px; }
    .report-section { padding:18px 0 22px; border-bottom:1px solid #d7dde8; }
    h2 { margin:0 0 12px; font-size:24px; color:#111; }
    h2::before { content:attr(id); display:none; }
    .placeholder { min-height:90px; border:1px dashed #b8c0cf; background:#fbfaf7; color:#7b8190; padding:24px; font-size:16px; }
    .panel-tabs { position:sticky; top:0; z-index:50; display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px; padding:18px 0 10px; border-bottom:1px solid #d7dde8; background:rgba(255,253,249,.96); backdrop-filter:blur(8px); }
    .panel-tab { appearance:none; border:1px solid #cbd5e1; background:#f8fafc; color:#344054; padding:8px 16px; min-height:42px; border-radius:3px; font-family:inherit; font-size:18px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; }
    .panel-tab:hover { border-color:#b4493f; color:#0b2f66; }
    .panel-tab.active { background:#b4493f; border-color:#b4493f; color:white; }
    .report-panel { display:none; }
    .report-panel.active { display:block; }
    .subpanel { scroll-margin-top:76px; margin:12px 0 18px; padding:10px; border:1px solid #d7dde8; background:#fbfcff; }
    .subpanel > h3 { margin:0 0 10px; font-size:20px; color:#0b2f66; border-left:5px solid #0b2f66; padding-left:9px; }
    .stack { display:grid; gap:14px; }
    .grid-2 { display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:14px; align-items:start; }
    .card { border:1px solid #bfc8d8; background:white; overflow:hidden; }
    .wide-card { grid-column:1 / -1; }
    .card-head { background:#d9e2f3; border-bottom:1px solid #aeb8c8; padding:7px 10px; text-align:center; }
    .card-head h3 { margin:0; font-size:17px; color:#001f55; }
    .card-head p { margin:2px 0 0; font-size:12px; color:#475569; }
    .card-body { padding:10px; overflow:auto; }
    table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:12px; background:white; }
    th, td { border:1px solid #c9ced8; padding:5px 7px; text-align:right; white-space:nowrap; font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums; }
    th { background:#e5ebf6; color:#0f2d5c; font-weight:700; }
    th:first-child, td:first-child { text-align:left; }
    .spot-summary-table { font-size:13px; }
    .spot-summary-table .latest-col { background:#fff1f0; border-left:2px solid #b4493f; border-right:2px solid #b4493f; font-weight:700; }
    .recent-values { text-align:left; white-space:normal; min-width:260px; }
    .recent-values span { display:inline-block; margin:1px 5px 1px 0; padding:1px 5px; border:1px solid #d7dde8; background:#f8fafc; border-radius:3px; }
    .date-value { display:inline-flex; flex-direction:column; align-items:flex-end; gap:1px; line-height:1.18; }
    .date-value span { color:#64748b; font-size:11px; font-weight:400; }
    .date-value b { color:#0f172a; font-size:13px; font-weight:700; }
    .table-card .card-body { max-height:520px; }
    .full-table .card-body { max-height:none; overflow:visible; }
    .storage-summary-block + .storage-summary-block { margin-top:12px; }
    .storage-summary-block h4 { margin:0; padding:6px 8px; border:1px solid #c9ced8; border-bottom:0; background:#f8fafc; color:#0f2d5c; font-size:15px; }
    .image-card .card-body { overflow:visible; }
    .reference-image { display:block; width:100%; height:auto; background:white; }
    .heat td { min-width:72px; }
    .table-note { margin:8px 2px 0; color:#64748b; font-size:12px; }
    .summary-text { font-size:16px; line-height:1.8; color:#111827; }
    .summary-text p { margin:0 0 8px; }
    .summary-text strong { color:#b91c1c; }
    .editable-summary-tools { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; align-items:center; gap:8px; padding:8px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid #d7dde8; background:#f8fafc; }
    .summary-tool-btn { appearance:none; border:1px solid #b9c3d3; background:white; color:#0f2d5c; min-height:32px; padding:5px 12px; border-radius:3px; font-family:inherit; font-size:14px; font-weight:700; cursor:pointer; }
    .summary-tool-btn:hover { border-color:#b4493f; color:#b4493f; }
    .summary-tool-btn.primary { background:#0b2f66; border-color:#0b2f66; color:white; }
    .editable-summary-status { margin-left:auto; color:#64748b; font-size:12px; }
    .editable-summary-body { min-height:118px; outline:none; border:1px solid transparent; padding:4px 6px; }
    .editable-summary-body[contenteditable="true"] { border-color:#b4493f; background:#fffaf2; box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(180,73,63,.18); }
    .editable-summary-body[contenteditable="true"] p { cursor:text; }
    .pos { color:#b91c1c; font-weight:700; }
    .neg { color:#1d4ed8; font-weight:700; }
    .mini-chart-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4, minmax(260px,1fr)); gap:10px; }
    .mini-chart-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, minmax(280px,1fr)); gap:10px; }
    .storage-smm-monthly-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(3, minmax(300px,1fr)); }
    .storage-xunxi-monthly-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(3, minmax(300px,1fr)); }
    .storage-headline-weekly-grid { grid-template-columns:repeat(4, minmax(240px,1fr)); }
    .storage-headline-price-wide { margin-top:14px; padding-top:10px; border-top:1px solid #d7dde8; }
    .chart-group-title { margin:12px 0 8px; color:#0b2f66; font-size:18px; text-align:center; }
    .overseas-chart-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, minmax(360px,1fr)); gap:12px; }
    .spot-season-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, minmax(420px,1fr)); gap:16px; align-items:start; }
    .spot-season-grid .svg-title { font-size:16px; }
    .spot-season-grid .svg-axis { font-size:12px; }
    .spot-season-grid .svg-legend { font-size:11px; }
    .decadal-chart-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(520px,1fr)); gap:14px; }
    .net-transfer-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(2, minmax(560px,1fr)); gap:14px; align-items:start; }
    .regional-structure-grid { display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3, minmax(360px,1fr)); gap:10px; align-items:start; }
    .regional-structure-svg { border:1px solid #d7dde8; background:#fff; }
    .regional-structure-title { font-size:18px; font-weight:700; fill:#0b2f66; }
    .regional-structure-date { font-size:12px; fill:#64748b; }
    .regional-structure-total { font-size:13px; fill:#334155; }
    .regional-structure-inside { font-size:11px; font-weight:700; fill:white; paint-order:stroke; stroke:#334155; stroke-width:2px; }
    .regional-structure-legend { font-size:11px; fill:#111827; }
    .industry-chain-svg { border:1px solid #d7dde8; }
    .industry-chain-title { font-size:22px; font-weight:700; fill:#0b2f66; }
    .industry-chain-col-title { font-size:18px; font-weight:700; fill:white; }
    .industry-chain-item { font-size:14px; fill:#0f172a; }
    .industry-chain-note { font-size:15px; fill:#334155; }
    .industry-panorama-image { max-height:760px; object-fit:contain; }
    svg { width:100%; height:auto; display:block; background:white; }
    svg text { font-family:"Times New Roman","KaiTi","楷体","STKaiti",serif; }
    .svg-title { font-size:14px; font-weight:700; fill:#0b2f66; }
    .svg-axis { font-size:10px; fill:#334155; }
    .svg-legend { font-size:8px; }
    .latest-label { font-size:11px; font-weight:700; paint-order:stroke; stroke:white; stroke-width:3px; }
    .chart-point { cursor:crosshair; }
    .interactive-chart { position:relative; background:white; }
    .interactive-toolbar { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:8px 12px; padding:2px 0 8px; }
    .interactive-toggle { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:5px; color:#0f172a; font-size:12px; cursor:pointer; }
    .interactive-toggle::before { content:""; width:18px; height:3px; background:var(--line-color); display:inline-block; }
    .interactive-toggle input { width:13px; height:13px; margin:0; accent-color:#0b2f66; }
    .interactive-stage { position:relative; }
    .spot-line-card .interactive-toggle { font-size:15px; font-weight:700; }
    .spot-line-card .interactive-toggle::before { width:24px; height:4px; }
    .spot-line-card .interactive-toggle input { width:16px; height:16px; }
    .spot-line-card .svg-title { font-size:18px; }
    .spot-line-card .svg-axis { font-size:13px; }
    .spot-line-card .latest-label { font-size:13px; }
    .chart-tooltip { display:none; position:absolute; z-index:20; min-width:190px; max-width:320px; pointer-events:none; background:rgba(15,23,42,.94); color:white; border-radius:6px; padding:10px 12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.55; box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(15,23,42,.28); }
    .chart-tooltip .tip-date { font-weight:700; color:#dbeafe; margin-bottom:5px; font-size:17px; }
    .global-chart-tooltip { position:fixed; white-space:normal; }
    .rotated { writing-mode:tb; glyph-orientation-vertical:0; }
    .industry-bar-svg { width:100%; }
    .industry-axis { font-size:16px; dominant-baseline:hanging; }
    .net-transfer-axis { font-size:13px; fill:#0f2d5c; text-anchor:end; dominant-baseline:middle; }
    .capacity-title { font-size:26px; fill:#4b5563; }
    .capacity-axis { font-size:18px; fill:#4b5563; text-anchor:end; dominant-baseline:middle; }
    .side-toc { position:fixed; left:0; top:0; bottom:0; z-index:70; width:154px; overflow:auto; padding:42px 12px 18px; background:rgba(255,253,249,.98); border-right:1px solid #cbd5e1; box-shadow:8px 0 22px rgba(15,23,42,.08); }
    .side-toc div { color:#0b2f66; font-size:16px; font-weight:700; margin:0 0 8px; }
    .side-toc a { display:block; color:#334155; text-decoration:none; font-size:13px; line-height:1.2; padding:7px 6px; border-left:3px solid transparent; }
    .side-toc a:hover { color:#0b2f66; background:#eef3fb; border-left-color:#b4493f; }
    .sources { padding:16px 22px 26px; font-size:12px; color:#596273; line-height:1.7; }
    @media(max-width:1100px) {
      .grid-2, .mini-chart-row, .mini-chart-grid, .overseas-chart-grid, .spot-season-grid, .decadal-chart-grid, .net-transfer-grid, .regional-structure-grid { grid-template-columns:1fr; }
      .page { width:100%; margin:0; border:0; box-shadow:none; }
      body { padding-left:0; }
      header { padding:14px 14px 10px; }
      h1 { font-size:24px; }
      .panel-tabs { flex-wrap:nowrap; gap:6px; overflow-x:auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; padding:8px; white-space:nowrap; }
      .panel-tab { flex:0 0 auto; min-height:34px; padding:6px 10px; font-size:14px; }
      .side-toc { position:sticky; top:50px; z-index:75; width:100%; max-height:none; padding:7px 8px; display:flex; gap:6px; overflow-x:auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; border-right:0; border-bottom:1px solid #cbd5e1; box-shadow:none; }
      .side-toc div { display:none; }
      .side-toc a { flex:0 0 auto; padding:5px 9px; border:1px solid #d7dde8; border-left:0; border-radius:3px; background:#f8fafc; font-size:13px; line-height:1.15; white-space:nowrap; }
      .side-toc a:hover { border-left:0; border-color:#b4493f; }
      main { padding:0 10px 18px; }
    }
    @media(max-width:720px) {
      body { font-size:14px; }
      header { padding:10px 10px 8px; }
      h1 { font-size:22px; }
      main { padding:0 6px 14px; }
      h2 { margin:8px 0; font-size:20px; }
      .report-section { padding:8px 0 16px; }
      .subpanel { scroll-margin-top:92px; margin:8px 0 12px; padding:6px; }
      .subpanel > h3 { font-size:17px; padding-left:7px; }
      .card-head { padding:6px 8px; }
      .card-head h3 { font-size:16px; }
      .card-head p { font-size:11px; line-height:1.35; }
      .card-body { padding:7px; }
      table { min-width:720px; font-size:11px; }
      .spot-summary-table { min-width:860px; font-size:11px; }
      th, td { padding:4px 5px; }
      .table-card .card-body, .full-table .card-body { max-height:none; overflow-x:auto; overflow-y:visible; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; }
      .full-table table th:first-child, .full-table table td:first-child,
      .table-card table th:first-child, .table-card table td:first-child { position:sticky; left:0; z-index:2; background:white; }
      .full-table table th:first-child, .table-card table th:first-child { z-index:3; background:#e5ebf6; }
      .summary-text { font-size:14px; line-height:1.65; }
      .editable-summary-tools { gap:6px; padding:6px; }
      .summary-tool-btn { min-height:30px; padding:4px 9px; font-size:12px; }
      .editable-summary-status { width:100%; margin-left:0; font-size:11px; }
      .interactive-toolbar { flex-wrap:nowrap; gap:6px; overflow-x:auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling:touch; padding-bottom:6px; }
      .interactive-toggle { flex:0 0 auto; gap:4px; font-size:10px; white-space:nowrap; }
      .interactive-toggle::before { width:16px; height:3px; }
      .interactive-toggle input { width:12px; height:12px; }
      .spot-line-card .interactive-toggle { font-size:11px; }
      .spot-line-card .interactive-toggle::before { width:18px; height:3px; }
      .spot-line-card .interactive-toggle input { width:13px; height:13px; }
      .svg-title { font-size:12px; }
      .svg-axis { font-size:8px; }
      .svg-legend { font-size:7px; }
      .latest-label { font-size:8px; }
      .spot-line-card .svg-title { font-size:13px; }
      .spot-line-card .svg-axis { font-size:9px; }
      .spot-line-card .latest-label { font-size:9px; }
      .industry-axis { font-size:11px; }
      .net-transfer-axis { font-size:9px; }
      .capacity-title { font-size:18px; }
      .capacity-axis { font-size:12px; }
      .regional-structure-title { font-size:15px; }
      .regional-structure-date, .regional-structure-total, .regional-structure-legend { font-size:10px; }
      .regional-structure-inside { font-size:9px; }
      .chart-tooltip { min-width:160px; max-width:calc(100vw - 28px); padding:8px 10px; font-size:12px; }
      .chart-tooltip .tip-date { font-size:14px; }
      .sources { padding:12px 10px 18px; font-size:10px; }
    }
  </style>
<style id="power-chart-upgrade-style">
.power-chart-shell{min-width:0;width:100%;position:relative;margin:4px 0 8px;overflow:hidden}
.power-chart-title{font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#0b2f66;line-height:1.45;padding:4px 8px;text-align:center;overflow-wrap:anywhere}
.power-chart-canvas{width:100%;height:var(--power-chart-height,320px);min-width:0;touch-action:pan-y}
.power-chart-years{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:center;padding:4px 10px;font-size:12px}
.power-chart-years:empty{display:none}.power-chart-years label{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:3px;white-space:nowrap;cursor:pointer}
.power-chart-years input{accent-color:#0b2f66}
@media(max-width:760px){.power-chart-title{font-size:14px}.power-chart-canvas{height:300px}.power-chart-years{gap:7px;padding:4px}}
</style><script data-power-chart-vendor="" defer="" src="assets/echarts.min.js"></script><style id="mobile-pages-overrides">
      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
      body { min-width: 0; }
      .side-toc { display: none !important; }
      main { margin-left: 0 !important; min-width: 0; }
      .split-page-tabs {
        position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 95; display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap;
        gap: 6px; overflow-x: auto; padding: 8px 0; white-space: nowrap;
        background: rgba(255,253,249,.98); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
        scrollbar-width: none; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      }
      .split-page-tabs::-webkit-scrollbar, .section-page-nav::-webkit-scrollbar { display: none; }
      .split-tab, .section-link {
        flex: 0 0 auto; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none;
        background: #f8fafc; color: #344054; font-weight: 750; white-space: nowrap;
      }
      .split-tab { min-width: 4.4rem; min-height: 36px; padding: 7px 10px; font-size: 14px; }
      .split-tab.active { color: #fff; background: #b4493f; border-color: #b4493f; }
      .section-page-nav {
        position: sticky; top: 53px; z-index: 90; display: flex; gap: 6px;
        overflow-x: auto; padding: 8px 0 10px; margin: -2px 0 8px;
        background: rgba(255,253,249,.98); scrollbar-width: none;
        -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      }
      .section-link { min-height: 32px; max-width: 82vw; padding: 6px 9px; font-size: 13px; }
      .section-link.active { color: #fff; background: #183a6b; border-color: #183a6b; }
      .report-panel > h2 { margin-top: 10px; }
      img { max-width: 100%; height: auto; }
      .card-body, .table-scroll { overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; }
      @media (max-width: 760px) {
        header, main { width: auto !important; max-width: none !important; }
        header { padding-left: 12px !important; padding-right: 12px !important; }
        main { padding: 0 8px 28px !important; }
        h1 { font-size: 23px !important; line-height: 1.2; }
        .subpanel { padding: 6px; margin: 8px 0 12px; }
        .subpanel > h3 { font-size: 17px; }
        .grid-2, .chart-grid, .spot-season-grid, .overseas-chart-grid { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) !important; }
        table { min-width: 620px; }
        svg {
          display: block;
          width: 100% !important;
          max-width: 100% !important;
          min-width: 0 !important;
          height: auto !important;
        }
        .card-head h3 { font-size: 16px !important; }
        .card-head p, .table-note, .source-note { font-size: 12px !important; }
      }
    </style></head>
<body>
<div class="page">
<nav aria-label="子面板目录" class="side-toc"><div>目录</div><a href="index.html#overview-core">1.1 发电用电</a><a href="overview-overview-investment.html#overview-investment">1.2 电源电网</a><a href="price.html#price-spot">2.1 现货电价</a><a href="price-price-table.html#price-table">2.2 代理电价</a><a href="price-overseas-americas-daily.html#price-overseas">2.3 海外电价</a><a href="price-price-long-contract.html#price-long-contract">2.4 长协电价</a><a href="price-price-capacity.html#price-capacity">2.5 容量电价</a><a href="supply.html#supply-generation">3.1 发电量</a><a href="supply-supply-capacity.html#supply-capacity">3.2 装机</a><a href="supply-supply-regional.html#supply-regional">3.3 分地区发电</a><a href="supply-supply-decadal.html#supply-decadal">3.4 旬度发电</a><a href="supply-supply-utilization-hours.html#supply-utilization-hours">3.5 利用小时</a><a href="supply-supply-regional-structure.html#supply-regional-structure">3.6 分省结构</a><a href="supply-supply-nuclear-maintenance.html#supply-nuclear-maintenance">3.7 核电检修</a><a href="supply-supply-hydrology.html#supply-hydrology">3.8 水电站水情</a><a href="demand.html#demand-total">4.1 用电总量</a><a href="demand-demand-industry.html#demand-industry">4.2 分行业用电</a><a href="trade.html#trade-long-term">5.1 中长期交易</a><a href="trade-trade-center.html#trade-center">5.2 交易中心</a><a href="trade-trade-net-transfer.html#trade-net-transfer">5.3 净输出</a><a href="policy.html#policy-market">6.1 电力市场政策</a><a href="policy-policy-renewable.html#policy-renewable">6.2 新能源政策</a><a href="policy-policy-storage.html#policy-storage">6.3 储能政策</a><a href="storage.html#storage-monthly-install">7.1 储能装机</a><a href="storage-storage-headline-weekly.html#storage-headline-weekly">7.2 储能头条周度</a></nav>
<header>
<h1>20261022国内电力看板 手机版</h1>
</header>
